# Nothing in this toolkit reads environment variables -- the personas are
# plain prompt files. This exists only for the case where you wire them
# into your own script that calls an AI provider's API directly.
#
# Copy to .env (which is gitignored) and fill in only what your script
# actually uses. Never commit the real .env.

# AI_PROVIDER_API_KEY=your-api-key-here
# AI_MODEL=your-model-name-here
